OL,3,ABritish Steel plan lacks credibility,
OL,4,AMPs say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for DBIST said it
OL,7,Fwelcomed the report and would review
OL,8,Fthe recommendations, adding securing
OL,9,Fthe long-term future of the UK steel
OL,10,Fsector "was in the national interest".
